  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the 2018 Population and Housing Census in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to training of enumerators to conduct the 2018 population and housing census. The National Statistical Office of Malawi will conduct the training, supported by UNFPA. The Norwegian contribution will cover the training of around 2000 enumerators, out of a total need of some 30000 enumerators and supervisors.</narrative>
  </description>
